# one session ago. What changed is that I tried the alternative and
# MEASURED it: compressing the four longest invariants -- V29, V34, V37 and
# V38, all written in the same recent house style -- bought 72 tokens.
# Compression is spent. The driver is the COUNT (39 invariants, 50 tasks),
# not the length of any one of them.
#
# Federating section R was considered and REJECTED. At 162 lines this file
# is far under FORMAT.md's 500-line threshold, and splitting it would be
# the "grep ceremony" that rule exists to prevent -- solving verbosity with
# structure, which is the wrong tool applied loudly.
#
# Slack is ~7%, deliberately tighter than the ~12.5% used before. The next
# addition should NOT be absorbed: it should force merging overlapping
# invariants, which is the debt this number now tracks.
#
# RE-MEASURED 2026-08-22, after the amendment that unblocked T12/T13/T26,
# T19 and T33:
#   SPEC.md    8619
#   README.md   842
#
